## Enforcement

| Gate | Command | Fail condition |
|---|---|---|
| Design system bundle | `pnpm design-system:check` | Parity, shadcn primitive boundary, or consumer token audit failure |
| Token parity | `pnpm audit:tailwind-token-parity` | CSS ↔ `design-system.ts` drift, missing `@theme` fill, orphan `@utility` |
| Shadcn primitive boundary | `pnpm audit:shadcn-primitives` | Four-layer contract drift: upstream manifest, tokens, exports/structure, interface-lab scaffold |
| Build gate | `@afenda/governed-surface` `pnpm build` (runs `audit:design-tokens` first) | Any `error`-level violation in `governed-surface` |
| CI / local | `pnpm audit:governed-design-tokens --strict` | Same as build gate |
| Consumer scan | `pnpm audit:governed-design-tokens --scope=all --strict` | Errors and warnings in features/app/governed |
| Composition | `pnpm audit:shadcn-composition --strict` | Nested Card, fake card divs, SectionPanel preference — see `packages/ui/COMPOSITION.md` |
| Renderer parity | `pnpm lint:governed-renderers` | Registry/contract mismatch |
| Architecture | `pnpm architecture:check` | Package boundary violation |

Run all gates before closing a PR that touches `packages/governed-surface`, `packages/ui/src/design-system.ts`, or `apps/erp/src/app/globals.css`.
